00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.030
It wasn't a joke...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.070
What?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.030
Suzuho...

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.910
It wasn't a joke, so...

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.860
A few days later, Suzuho passed away.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:07.800
Hasegawa Suzuho's death seems to have been predetermined as well.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.200
It couldn't be helped.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:14.370
That time, had she no obtained the sealing ribbon,

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:17.050
