00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.560
There's nobody...

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:53.900
Really?

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.360
There was never anyone.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.110
Even in the depths of your heart?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.140
Do not be embarrassed, let it all out.

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:06.770
Desires are not always evil.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.090
It is a disgrace only if you are not able to control them.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.330
But I...

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.130
What do you desire?

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.370
Whom do you desire?

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.050
You...

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:17.960
It's impossible!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.870
I could never have such a person.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:23.350
It's just a delusion of my heart!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.960
That's why you should give it a form.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.340
Picture it.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.530
Speak of it.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.020
Create its form.

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:35.130
Of the dream you thought to be lost.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.620
My... dream...?

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.720
In my heart.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.680
I would want a happy girl.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.460
A lively girl.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.290
An honest girl.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.380
An innocent girl.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:00.530
But a stubborn girl.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.850
I did it.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.900
This can't be!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:18.170
The future should converge as I calculated!

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.070
Professor...

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.840
The final test is complete.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.260
All green.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:32.690
I thank you all for dealing with my crazy delusions these past 40 years.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:37.670
But from this moment on, this is not a delusion anymore.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:41.040
By carving it out, dreams take form.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:44.910
With the proper effort given, they receive actual shape.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.220
And now, the result lies here.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.470
N-No way!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.600
Where did I miscalculate?!

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:09.840
Were you hungry?

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:11.360
Drink a lot.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.580
You will be together with me, forever.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.540
Yes your name...

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:22.760
Tanarotte...

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:26.710
Now is the time for your awakening.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:38.400
You finally remembered me.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:41.650
It's been such a long time...

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.860
A lot of time passed since you created me.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.320
Tanarotte...

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:50.490
Now it's you who will awaken!

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:57.080
I am here because you wished for me.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:00.330
Takuto!

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:05.340
Tanarotte...

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:13.180
Why?!

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.560
My calculations were perfect!

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:19.980
Dr. Habarom, this was predetermined.

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:25.280
The existence called Tanarotte was born from within Hasegawa Takuto.

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:27.900
Therefore, it could be said that she is a part of him.

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.040
Even in another time, or in another shape,

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:34.470
the essence of the spirit that lies within a person will always be the same.

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:36.120
It is eternal.

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:39.310
However hard you try to change his history...

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:40.880
They will always meet.

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:44.990
It is something that has already been predetermined for his world.

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:47.640
Can you not think of it that way?

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:51.140
So, things happen as they should happen...

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:56.520
Whatever happened, I will be together with you.

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:59.400
You mustn't ever forget that.

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:00.710
Tanarotte!

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:02.960
That's right.

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:20.520
